run `./gradlew bootRun` from this checkout, then `./gradlew test-e2e --tests '*ProductPageE2ETest'`.\n- **The break patches:** there is one per test under `tasks/CAT-02/breaks/`. Each makes one small change to the page template or the page model so that only its own test should fail. I wrote them by hand because `git apply --check` and editing the files temporarily both needed approval. The story gate will be the first to apply them.\n\nOne thing to be aware of: the session start showed a worker (`runner:zuse.local:4707`) holding this checkout, while CAT-01 waits for your answer. You asked for this stage directly, so I ran it anyway.","ttft_ms":2519,"type":"result","duration_ms":278532,"uuid":"d83c35c3-b3e7-4df6-8d03-eac2099e43f9","ttft_stream_ms":1608,"time_to_request_ms":84,"first_content_frame_ms":1608,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
